# Prishe's Wanderings: "When you search your library this way, put a +1/+1 counter on target creature you control." The
# reflexive ability triggers on the search itself (CR 603.12, 701.23b), not on a card being found: with only nonbasic,
# non-Town lands in the library, Bot1 finds nothing (Tropical Island is refused), the library is still shuffled, no land
# enters, and Llanowar Elves still gets its +1/+1 counter.

[Bot1 Deck]
Black Lotus
Mox Emerald
Llanowar Elves
Prishe's Wanderings
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Pearl
Tropical Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Llanowar Elves.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Black Lotus.Cast
Bot1.Battlefield.Black Lotus.Activate(Color: Green)
Bot1.Hand.Prishe's Wanderings.Cast
! Bot1.Search(Tropical Island)
Bot1.Search()
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot1.Battlefield.Count = 2
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = 1
Bot1.Battlefield.Llanowar Elves.Power = 2
Bot1.Shuffles = 1
